<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Claude Code"><diagram name="BMC" id="bmc"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2000" pageHeight="880" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Business Model Canvas - StockPro" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#F9F9F9;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#001F3F;align=left;spacingLeft=40;"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="2000" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pc" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;8. Parcerias-chave&lt;/div&gt;• Mercado Pago (cobrança recorrente)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Provedor de hospedagem/nuvem&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Serviço de e-mail transacional (Resend)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Contadores e associações comerciais da região (indicação)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="0" y="110" width="400.0" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;7. Atividades-chave&lt;/div&gt;• Desenvolver e manter a plataforma&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Garantir segurança e integridade dos dados&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Suporte e implantação (importação CSV)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Divulgação digital&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="400.0" y="110" width="400.0" height="260.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rc" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;6. Recursos-chave&lt;/div&gt;• Plataforma StockPro (código e banco PostgreSQL)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Infraestrutura em nuvem&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Equipe de desenvolvimento&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Conhecimento do domínio de estoque&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="400.0" y="370.0" width="400.0" height="260.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pv" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;2. Proposta de valor&lt;/div&gt;• Controle de estoque web simples, sem instalação&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Saldo sempre consistente, inclusive com baixas simultâneas&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Alertas de estoque baixo e sugestão de reposição&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Equipe com acesso limitado; custo e margem protegidos&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Dados isolados por empresa&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 7 dias grátis, depois R$ 50,00/mês&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="800.0" y="110" width="400.0" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rl" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;4. Relacionamento&lt;/div&gt;• Autoatendimento com teste grátis&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Suporte por e-mail e WhatsApp&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Apoio na implantação inicial&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="1200.0" y="110" width="400.0" height="260.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cn" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;3. Canais&lt;/div&gt;• Site com cadastro e teste grátis&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Indicação de clientes e parceiros&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Redes sociais&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Contato direto com o comércio local&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="1200.0" y="370.0" width="400.0" height="260.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sc" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;1. Segmentos de clientes&lt;/div&gt;• Pequenas e médias empresas de Franca-SP e região que controlam estoque em planilhas&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Comércio varejista, papelarias, lojas de informática e operações de venda on-line&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Proprietários, gerentes e estoquistas&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="1600.0" y="110" width="400.0" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cs" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;9. Estrutura de custos&lt;/div&gt;• Hospedagem do sistema e do banco de dados&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Domínio e e-mail transacional&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Tarifas do Mercado Pago por cobrança&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Divulgação e tempo da equipe&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="0" y="630" width="1000.0" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fr" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#001F3F;color:#F9F9F9;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 8px;margin:-8px -10px 10px -12px;&quot;&gt;5. Fontes de receita&lt;/div&gt;• Assinatura mensal recorrente de R$ 50,00 por empresa&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Pagamento via Mercado Pago (cartão de crédito)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Evolução: plano anual e planos por número de usuários&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#001F3F;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A2233;"><mxGeometry x="1000.0" y="630" width="1000.0" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="obs" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Rascunho elaborado a partir do escopo do projeto - a validar pela equipe" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#5B6675;align=left;"><mxGeometry x="0" y="850" width="2000" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>